+<footer>Based on <a href="https://github.com/kermeow/RhythiaRewrite">RhythiaRewrite</a> · <a href="https://github.com/Evaxle/Web-Rhythia">Source &amp; licence</a></footer>
+</main>
+</div>
+<div id="tools" hidden><span id="storage"></span><button id="import" type="button">Import .sspm</button><input id="files" type="file" accept=".sspm" multiple hidden></div>
